Package: pbtm
Type: Package
Title: Population-Based Threshold Models of Seed Germination
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Pedro", "Bello", email = "pedrobello@gmail.com", role = "cre"),
    person("Ben", "Bradford", email = "bradfordium@gmail.com", role = "aut"))
Description: Fits population-based threshold models (PBTMs) to seed
    germination time courses. Supports thermal time, hydrotime, hydrothermal
    time, hydropriming, hydrothermal priming, aging, promoter and inhibitor
    models, optional mixtures of seed subpopulations, germination speed
    calculations, and plots of the fitted models on linear or linearized
    (log time, probit fraction) scales.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/pbt-models/pbtm
BugReports: https://github.com/pbt-models/pbtm/issues
